sonic-platform-modules-ciena (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release for SONiC
  * Support for Ciena 8140 platforms
  * I2C controller drivers (i2c-ciena, i2c-ciena-smb, i2c-fpga-mux)
  * Common modules: thermal, fan, GPIO, reset, LED, regmap
  * Platform-specific CIC driver (rudra40_cic)

